{"title": "[情報] 今日James Harden", "author": "SeanLi1013 (TrunksHOPE)", "board": "", "date": "Sat Nov 21 10:56:34 2026", "url": "https://www.ptt.cc/bbs/NBA/M.1795229797.A.99D.html", "body": "https://www.nba.com/game/ind-vs-cle-0022600045/box-score\n\n今日James Harden\n\n51分6助攻6籃板\nFG：15-26\n3PT：7-11\nFT：14-14\n\nhttps://x.com/screwballnba/status/2123964468350570541\n\nJames Harden became the oldest player in Cavaliers history to score 40+ points\n tonight (37-086), surpassing LeBron James.\n\nJames Harden今晚成為騎士隊史上最年長的單場得分突破40分的球員（37歲又86天），超\n越LeBron James，創下隊史紀錄。\n\nhttps://x.com/cavsnotes/status/2123960950063550653\n\n@JHarden13 just moved past Shaquille O’Neal (33,846 PTS) for the 9th-most com\nbined regular season and postseason points in NBA history.\n\n* Wilt Chamberlain (35,026)\n* James Harden (33,849)\n* Shaquille O’Neal (33,846)\n* Tim Duncan (31,668)\n\nJames needed 25 PTS to pass O’Neal entering tonight.\n\n#LetEmKnow\n\nJames Harden剛剛正式超越 Shaquille O’Neal（33,846 分），升上NBA歷史例行賽加季\n後賽總得分榜第9名。\n\n* Wilt Chamberlain（35,026 分）\n* James Harden（33,849 分）\n* Shaquille O’Neal（33,846 分）\n* Tim Duncan（31,668 分）\n\nHarden在今晚比賽開始前，只需要再拿下25分，就能超越O’Neal。\n\n#LetEmKnow\n\nhttps://x.com/espninsights/status/2123965511868289218\n\nJames Harden recorded his 346th career 30-point game, passing Allen Iverson an\nd tying Dominique Wilkins for the 10th most in NBA history.\n\nOnly four guards have more: Michael Jordan, Kobe Bryant, Oscar Robertson and J\nerry West\n\nJames Harden締造了生涯第346場單場得分至少30分的比賽，超越Allen Iverson，並追平\nDominique Wilkins，並列NBA歷史第10位！\n\n目前只有四位後衛的30分場次比他更多，分別是：\nMichael Jordan\nKobe Bryant\nOscar Robertson\nJerry West\n\nhttps://x.com/underdognba/status/2123973944961323427\n\nJames Harden passed Kobe Bryant for the 3rd-most 50-point games in NBA history\n:\n\nWilt Chamberlain - 118\nMichael Jordan - 31\nJames Harden - 26\nKobe Bryant - 25\n\nVintage Beard dropped 51 PTS in win vs. Pacers tonight.\n\nJames Harden正式超越Kobe Bryant，升上NBA歷史單場得分50分場次排行榜的第三名！\n\nNBA歷史單場至少攻下50分的場次紀錄：\n\nWilt Chamberlain－118 次\nMichael Jordan－31 次\nJames Harden－26 次\nKobe Bryant－25 次\n\n今晚，Vintage Beard，在對戰印第安納溜馬隊的比賽中，狂砍51分，帶領球隊贏得勝利\n。\n\n———\n心得：神燈！\n\nhttps://i.mopix.cc/zfyRIf.jpg", "comments": [{"tag": "推", "user": "inschool", "content": "錯哥我登了", "time": "11/21 10:57"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "yabaidesu", "content": "記錄夜贏球了", "time": "11/21 10:57"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "tsai529", "content": "老人熱身完畢 要開始認真了", "time": "11/21 10:57"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "IWF", "content": "誰敢再衝我大神燈哥，開放道歉", "time": "11/21 10:57"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "matico", "content": "37歲了還想怎樣", "time": "11/21 10:57"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "qwe0804", "content": "留名", "time": "11/21 10:57"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "felix0616", "content": "今天連突破切入運球都回來了 吃藥了拉", "time": "11/21 10:58"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "cysticercus", "content": "前一陣子還以為登哥要學中文了", "time": "11/21 10:58"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "peterw", "content": "燈哥還有油", "time": "11/21 10:58"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "asd667788", "content": "我鬍鬍哈哈", "time": "11/21 10:58"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "onepiecefan", "content": "猛", "time": "11/21 10:58"}, {"tag": "→", "user": "felix0616", "content": "小腿突然變有力 不是吃藥不然是什麼", "time": "11/21 10:58"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "knowledge56", "content": "感動 竟然還能看到登哥拿50", "time": "11/21 10:58"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "swatch790513", "content": "火箭登限時回歸！", "time": "11/21 10:58"}, {"tag": "→", "user": "munchlax", "content": "https://i.imgur.com/cCDYSdy.jpeg", "time": "11/21 10:58"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "XCaper", "content": "火箭登的日常（不是", "time": "11/21 10:59"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "yueyi313", "content": "登登：老納只是熱機比較慢一點而已～", "time": "11/21 10:59"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "cancer0708", "content": "神燈 騎士只能有一個詹姆斯", "time": "11/21 10:59"}, {"tag": "→", "user": "knowledge56", "content": "https://i.imgur.com/BqapOW1.png", "time": "11/21 10:59"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "Q12345Q", "content": "燈還有油啊", "time": "11/21 11:00"}, {"tag": "→", "user": "avrilrock", "content": "太誇張啦", "time": "11/21 11:00"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "cysti